          "title": "住宅墙",
          "content": "<p>加拿大有一个小镇，靠近北极，终年刮着强劲的北风。</p>\n<p>为了挡风，当地修建了高50米，长1.3公里的挡风墙，同时这堵墙里面还是住宅、商业和教育设置，里面可以住人。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202202/bg2022022006.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202202/bg2022022007.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p>因为有了这堵住宅墙，小镇居民就拥有了一个无风的、温暖的小气候。 </p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202202/bg2022022008.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202202/bg2022022009.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>",
